:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Killer Tank Cat (Rare Cat)]].''
'''Killer Tank Cat''' is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Killer Tank Cat
|image = E 633.png
|first appearance = [[Horde of Tank Cats]]
|money drop = 200¢ - 790¢
}}

==Enemy==
Killer Tank Cat behaves similarly to [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cat]], only with Area Attack, 30 less range, more health and only one knockback, making it a devastating threat if given the chance as he is spammed and overbuffed in many of his appearences.

==Strategy==
Killer Tank Cat's AOE attacks are able to decimate meatshields with ease, however, his even lower range than most meatshields makes him vulnerable to your usual anti-Darks, so the same strategies might be just as effective, taking slightly longer due to having nearly three times the health of Killer Cat. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] are among the more accessible counters you should use against them.

